  (text "U401 (pilink-e63): USBLC6-2SC6 (ST, LCSC C7519) USB ESD array at J401,\nbefore the 27R series resistors (R106/R107 on the RP2350B sheet). 2.5pF typ / 3.5pF max\nI/O-GND (ST datasheet DocID 11265 Table 2), rated for USB 2.0 FS/HS. VBUS pin on VBUS_RAW (rail clamp reference).\nD401 (pilink-e63): SMF5.0A unidirectional TVS (MDD, LCSC C193402), Vrwm 5.0V,\nVbr 6.4-7.0V, Vc 9.2V @ 21.7A, on +5V right after F401 so a sustained\novervoltage trips the PTC instead of destroying the TVS. Drawn with the\nzener symbol (K = pin 1 to +5V). It clamps ESD and hot-plug ringing; it\ncannot hold +5V under U1's 6.5V absolute max for a large surge." (at 163.83 133.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 3b5d8d1a-c3b1-41b4-b5f4-43679b3e2a1c)
  )
)
